Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,V-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a small wound can end up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.85,0:00:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a stubborn man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.35,0:00:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What Idget would get himself\Nkilled by his own Stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.07,0:01:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A little scratch is all it takes\Nfor my stand to get inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my stan will creep\Nunder your skin and kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.09,0:01:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going to get out of this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a toilet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.93,0:02:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always finding myself being\Nattacked in places like toilets!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, what a dirty bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.86,0:03:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're searching for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of\Ntime before they find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. I'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.85,0:03:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.37,0:03:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slice you to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.01,0:03:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't they attacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.19,0:04:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.51,0:05:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Her stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How the mighty have fallen, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see what you can do for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.71,0:05:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you start with that dirty\Ntoilet bowl By licking it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.53,0:05:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.03,0:06:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but I'm looking for a\NFrench guy named Jean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen him around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mr. Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff has stepped\Naway to the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.07,0:06:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Restroom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The restroom is through that door,\Ndown the hall, and on your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.11,0:06:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The restroom is through\Nthis door and to the right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.53,0:06:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jotaro. Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, how do you know Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,earlier he came to my\Nrescue when a drunkard
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,was having trouble keeping his\Nhands to himself, Mr. Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now you called me Jotaro,\Nbut how do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I told everyone not to mention my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, that includes Polnareff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the killer of my dearest son, J.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.15,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle, was to be disposed of first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But I suppose that can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.71,0:08:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you just a little bit worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you haven't\Nhad much time to think
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.97,0:08:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,about your companions while you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:08:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to find Jotaro anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.37,0:09:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the door right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.91,0:09:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world are\Nthese people? Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who was on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they... dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam, please, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that woman, Enya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.07,0:11:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the stand user in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She controls this fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And even the slightest wound\Nwill allow her to control you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like them, as a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already affected, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know when she'll\Nseize control of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She forced me to lick the\NToilet bowl, that bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get her for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, we have to find\Nthat woman as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But with all this madness going on, the\Ntown is now filled with dead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.39,0:11:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the big entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Beep!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.43,0:12:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mhm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:12:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Old splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.87,0:13:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.09,0:13:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you, our dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've fully\Nrecovered from your injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.73,0:14:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Holley, I will have to explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hit the main body,\Nor this will go on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Enya must be watching\Nfrom somewhere inside that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.71,0:15:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,hotel and laughing her\Nhead up at us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol, could I bother you for a light?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you certainly haven't aged\Nvery gracefully since I saw you last,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,have you, Enya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Enya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.83,0:16:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying this old\Nlady is a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.91,0:16:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Enya is a beautiful young woman,\Nnot some old hag like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.67,0:16:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know that too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to our past battles,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.65,0:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed a characteristic\Nthat's shared by all stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When a stand user inhales even a\Nsmall amount of cigarette smoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a vein in their\Nnose that surfaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.97,0:17:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But we found the sucker, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Enya's left hand, it was always hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son also had a right hand\Nin place of his left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really are that\Nwoman in disguise and J.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.19,0:17:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Giles' mother, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your left is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.27,0:18:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll put a hole in your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,When that happens, you're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't watch your step\Neven for a spits second,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll end up at the feet of your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.15,0:18:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you toy\Nwith Polnareff anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you take one more breath, I'll put\Nan end to that stand, once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you son-murdering, good-for-nothing,\Npretentious piece of crap scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.81,0:19:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum is inhaling Justice's head?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.31,0:20:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because I was careless,\NI dragged all of you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I should have known\Nthat something was wrong with her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, hiding her left hand like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.71,0:20:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought that old\Nhag was in disguise and was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you shot in the\Nhead by whole horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.61,0:20:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I did get shot right here in\Nthe center of my forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But Jaegyle stabbed me from\Nbehind, just as it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.41,0:20:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and the counterforce of his\Nblade pulled me backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.73,0:20:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so the bullet did not mortally wound me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.21,0:20:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.75,0:20:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,that you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:20:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.65,0:21:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do with the old woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a million questions about\NDio that I want to ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So when did you start to\Nsuspect this old woman, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,From the first moment I\Nlaid eyes on the old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,From the very beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She was just way too normal to be\Nhanging out with those weirdos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, just how did you\Nfind out where we were, Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got the phone call from Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.51,0:21:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar this morning telling me. A call?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.19,0:21:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.71,0:21:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But, but then, but, but then\Nthat would mean that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar knew that you were\Nalive this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.97,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.23,0:21:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as a matter of fact, in\NIndia, I was tended to by Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.77,0:22:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.91,0:22:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys already knew back in\NIndia that Avdol was alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but you didn't tell me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.37,0:22:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.28,0:22:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a bit of a loose\Ntongue. Yeah, if you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.19,0:22:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,foolishly blurted it out I\Nthought Avdol-san wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.13,0:22:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,be able to recover from\Nhis injuries in peace
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.39,0:22:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So I made the suggestion\Nto keep it quiet What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.57,0:22:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, shit. So I was the\Nonly one left out. Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.21,0:22:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.39,0:22:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.21,0:22:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.99,0:22:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A bud of flesh. Old
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.91,0:22:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.83,0:22:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the true nature of Dio's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell us what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.67,0:22:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, you've been betrayed by Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.39,0:22:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.30,0:23:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the kind of man you think he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.11,0:23:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.21,0:23:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.01,0:23:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Try asking Lord Deals instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.71,0:23:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.37,0:23:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio never allows anyone\Ninto his heart. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.93,0:24:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It is disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.99,0:24:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The city itself was a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.39,0:24:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that takes\Ncare of the burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.73,0:25:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a formidable enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.63,0:25:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.63,0:25:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that whole horse lying\Nover there in the dirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.95,0:25:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.79,0:25:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.21,0:25:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to be hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.99,0:25:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no longer a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.09,0:26:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.00,0:26:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,After crossing this desert,\Nwe'll finally be in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.89,0:26:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.49,0:26:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.47,0:28:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.05,0:29:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
